  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "フィールドを　はかい　しながら　こうげき。\nなんらかの　フィールドじょうたいに\nかわって　いないと　わざは　しっぱいする。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "필드를 파괴하면서 공격한다.\n필드가 어떤 상태로든 변해 있지 않은 경우\n기술은 실패한다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "一邊破壞場地，一邊進行攻擊。\n在不是特殊狀態的場地上使用，\n招式就會失敗。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Une attaque qui inflige des dégâts et fait disparaître\nle champ actif, mais qui échoue s’il n’y en a pas\nà ce moment.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Der Anwender greift an und zerstört dabei etwaige\nFelder. Ist kein Feld aktiv, schlägt die Attacke fehl.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "El usuario lanza su ataque y destruye el campo activo\nen el terreno de combate, y falla si no hay ninguno en\nese momento.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Chi la usa attacca eliminando lo stato del terreno\ndi lotta. La mossa fallisce se nel terreno non è attivo\nalcuno stato.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "The user attacks while destroying the terrain. This move\nfails when the ground hasn’t turned into a terrain.",
